  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Friends-International- Established in 1994, Friends-International protects and empowers CoM and other marginalized children in Cambodia, Thailand, Laos and Indonesia. Friends-International conducts prevention, provision, public awareness and advocacy to combat child trafficking in Thailand and Cambodia.</narrative>
